I started in accounting software, where you learn that a program is a promise
about numbers other people will be held to.

= How I work

I work in small pieces and write them down first. A project usually starts as a
page like this one: what it is for, what it refuses to do, and what would make
it a failure.

= Elsewhere

This page sits directly under `content/`, in no section, and the theme still
finds it, because the top nav reads the site's page catalogue and not a menu
someone has to remember to update.
